            <div class="container">
                <div class="facodi-section-heading">
                    <div>
                        <p class="facodi-kicker">
                            <i class="fa fa-circle" aria-hidden="true" t-translation="off"/>
                            How it works
                        </p>
                        <h2>Three ways to begin learning.</h2>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="facodi-stat-row">
                    <article class="facodi-stat-card facodi-mint">
                        <div class="facodi-stat-eyebrow">Step 01</div>
                        <div class="facodi-stat-title">Choose a Roadmap</div>
                        <div class="facodi-stat-copy">Start with a structured, publicly reviewed learning direction.</div>
